OL,11,G0232 Tech Life
OL,12,     FLots of people make a living from
OL,13,     Fsocial media posts. But some have
OL,14,     Fbeen targeted by an international
OL,15,     Fextortion scheme. It involves a
OL,16,     Fflood of false copyright
OL,17,     Finfringement claims.
